<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43265" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτήτῠμ-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		poet. redupl. for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔτυμος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>true</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐκ ἔσθ᾽ ὅδε μῦθος ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				23.62
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἄγγελος ἐλθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					22.438
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτήτυμα μυθησαίμην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἀγόρευσον
			ἐτήτυμον</span> tell me this <i>true</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				1.174
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτ᾽ ἐ</span>.; c.
			inf., is this <i>true</i>, that . . ? <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				737
			</span></i> (troch.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ λέγεις ἐτήτυμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					1290
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ᾽ ἐ</span>. but <i>the
			truth</i> is . . , <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pax</u>
				119
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>truthful</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ ψευδόμαντις . . ,
				ἀλλ᾽ ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Or.</u>
				1667
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. στόμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>IT</u>
					1085
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>genuine, real</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κείνῳ δ᾽ οὐκέτι
				νόστος ἐ</span>. for him there remains no <i>true,
			real</i> return, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				3.241
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀλάθεια, κλέος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>O.</u>
				10(11).54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>N.</u>
				7.63
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. Διὸς κόρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					948
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παῖς ἐ. γεγώς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Tr.</u>
					1064
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					12.37
				</span></i>
			: in late Prose, <i><span class="en">
				Them.
				<u>Or.</u>
				22.279d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as
			Adv., in neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐτήτυμον</span>, <i>truly, really</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				4.157
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				13.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				18.128
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				62
			</span></i> : regul. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μως</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				167
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				682
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>El.</u>
				1452
			</span></i>.</div>
